# Base URL the frontend uses to reach the MiniGPT backend.
#
# /api  -> same-origin path (recommended).
#          Local development: the Vite dev server forwards /api/* to
#          https://minigptfromscratch.vercel.app (see vite.config.ts).
#          Production on Vercel: vercel.json rewrites /api/* to the same backend.
#
# A full URL (for example https://minigptfromscratch.vercel.app) would make the
# browser call the backend directly, which only works if the backend sends CORS
# headers allowing the frontend's origin. That has not been verified.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api